flowchart LR
  Viewer[Explicit operator health read] --> Health[GET /api/v1/health]
  Health --> Contract[operations.v1 classifier]
  Contract --> HubA[RegionalFeedHub A aggregate view]
  Contract --> HubB[RegionalFeedHub B aggregate view]
  Contract --> HubC[RegionalFeedHub C aggregate view]
  HubA --> StoreA[(30-day aggregate counters and ages)]
  HubB --> StoreB[(30-day aggregate counters and ages)]
  HubC --> StoreC[(30-day aggregate counters and ages)]
  Contract --> Result[Application, provider, delivery, and freshness states]
  Privacy[Schema allowlist and privacy scanner] --> Contract
  Synthetic[Release-bound synthetic availability probe] --> Result
  Result --> Evidence[Evidence route and release receipt]
